ARM GAS  C:\Users\oleg\AppData\Local\Temp\ccu5UsLO.s 			page 2


  31:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  * Matrix of resampling methods used:
  32:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  *                                 Fs_out (kHz)
  33:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  *                        8      12     16     24     48
  34:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  *
  35:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  *               8        C      UF     U      UF     UF
  36:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  *              12        AF     C      UF     U      UF
  37:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  * Fs_in (kHz)  16        D      AF     C      UF     UF
  38:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  *              24        AF     D      AF     C      U
  39:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  *              48        AF     AF     AF     D      C
  40:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  *
  41:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  * C   -> Copy (no resampling)
  42:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  * D   -> Allpass-based 2x downsampling
  43:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  * U   -> Allpass-based 2x upsampling
  44:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  * UF  -> Allpass-based 2x upsampling followed by FIR interpolation
  45:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  * AF  -> AR2 filter followed by FIR interpolation
  46:../../opus/silk/resampler.c ****  */
  47:../../opus/silk/resampler.c **** 
